We've got a Microway UP2000+ system that's been working just fine for
the last year. That is, until it seems to have developed some hardware
related problems. It started with:

dc0: watchdog timeout
dc0: watchdog timeout
dc0: watchdog timeout
dc0: watchdog timeout
